---
description: Regression and behavior-test expectations
globs: tests/*.py,tests/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

Testing rules:
- add regression tests for every real bug fixed
- include forbidden-match tests, not just expected-match tests
- preserve these canonical scenarios:
  - laptop + rent late
  - coworker cover + burnt out
  - mom favor + drained
  - talking shit behind back
  - wait vs act now
- test:
  - winning family
  - forbidden families
  - first follow-up slot
  - confidence behavior
  - memory suppression when irrelevant
